{"parse": {"title": "迷思潮信", "pageid": 141646, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"迷思潮信\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b6/Item-642802.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"迷思潮信\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>迷思潮信</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#642802</div></div><hr /><div>扭转的、温热的脑海奇想，经受迷思的洗刷，灵感便愈发闪耀。用于唤起指定闪念，并将指定范围内对应角色的狂想或解构等级直升至MAX。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">于怪梦中醒来，遗留在脑叶缝隙间的痕迹，诉说着潜意识之海所馈赠的，那难以忘怀的温热灵感。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "迷思潮信"}}